{"id":1465,"kind":"battle","message":"Wren施展「野球拳」。","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:40.2980608\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1466,"kind":"growth","message":"Wren从10级升至11级。","notice":true,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:40.2985753\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1467,"kind":"battle","message":"战斗胜利，已按原有规则结算经验和掉落。","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:40.2986036\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1468,"kind":"operation","message":"施展招式：武功 野球拳，x 7，y 2","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:40.2986463\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1469,"kind":"dialogue","message":"李文秀：Stop! The smoke\u0027s clearing. It\u0027s you.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:40.3112051\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1470,"kind":"operation","message":"离开战斗","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:40.3113048\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1471,"kind":"dialogue","message":"主角：And those crates really are yours. We\u0027ve been fighting in Gines\u0027s curtain call.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:40.3227886\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1472,"kind":"dialogue","message":"瓦耳拉齐：Very moving. Could we skip the part where anyone asks who owned the smoke pot?","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:40.3313012\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1473,"kind":"dialogue","message":"李文秀：You painted the footprint to scare us away from our own food.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:40.3407811\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1474,"kind":"dialogue","message":"瓦耳拉齐：Why hire a giant when people will do the frightened part for free?","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:40.3575896\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1475,"kind":"dialogue","message":"李文秀：Father Perez and I will take the wagons home. The guards can deal with him.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:40.3743888\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1476,"kind":"dialogue","message":"主角：What about the crate marked \u0027Treasure\u0027?","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:40.3906941\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1477,"kind":"dialogue","message":"瓦耳拉齐：Books. Knights, castles, impossible promises. There\u0027s always a market.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:40.4079173\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1478,"kind":"dialogue","message":"李文秀：Keep that copy of Amadis of Gaul safe until we sort out the books. The knight has been asking about it.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:40.4265629\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1479,"kind":"dialogue","message":"主角：A book about knights. That explains quite a lot.","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:40.4439292\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1480,"kind":"item","message":"获得「河岳英灵集」×1","notice":true,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:40.4613806\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1481,"kind":"operation","message":"与地点交互：地点 高昌迷宫","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:40.4884725\u002B00:00","mapId":"高昌迷宫"},{"id":1482,"kind":"operation","message":"与地点交互：地点 返回","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:40.5060507\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1483,"kind":"operation","message":"与地点交互：地点 高昌迷宫","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:40.5222547\u002B00:00","mapId":"高昌迷宫"},{"id":1484,"kind":"operation","message":"与地点交互：地点 返回","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:40.5409951\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1485,"kind":"operation","message":"与地点交互：地点 高昌迷宫","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:40.5595975\u002B00:00","mapId":"高昌迷宫"},{"id":1486,"kind":"operation","message":"与地点交互：地点 返回","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:40.5791045\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1487,"kind":"operation","message":"与地点交互：地点 高昌迷宫","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:40.5974505\u002B00:00","mapId":"高昌迷宫"},{"id":1488,"kind":"operation","message":"与地点交互：地点 返回","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:40.6154980\u002B00:00","mapId":"大地图"},{"id":1489,"kind":"operation","message":"与地点交互：地点 高昌迷宫","notice":false,"time":"2026-10-25T05:18:40.6331255\u002B00:00","mapId":"高昌迷宫"},{"id":1490,"kind":"operation","message":"与地点交互：地点 返回","notice":false,"time":"